Read: `AGENTS.md`, then `docs/ai/AI_QUICK_CONTEXT.md`.

Rules:
- Search first (`rg`), open only relevant files, then make minimal diffs.
- Do not paste large files; cite `path:line`.
- Use Models + prepared statements; avoid `SELECT *`.
- CSRF required on all state-changing requests.
- Never edit generated assets: `public_html/assets/**/dist/**`.
- No secrets: never commit `.env` or paste real tokens/keys.

Verify:
- `php -l path/to/file.php`
- `php scripts/quality_scan.php`

